  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDEV Evaluation Week</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Originally scheduled for early November 2015, Evaluation Week has been postponed to the first quarter of 2016, most likely mid-March. It was postponed due to various environmental and logistics factors, which presented challenges to several high level speakers and participants.

While planning for the event is ongoing, the draft program and the list of proposed high level speakers and participants will be discussed with the AfDB President, who has been briefed about the event and is keen to help shape it. The purpose is to develop a program that responds to the international context (transition from MDGs to SDGs, changes in development financing), the role of the AfDB and its operational priorities, and the contribution that lesson learning and knowledge exchange can make.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
